ánh va đập \u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThanh treo bo góc mềm mại, sản phẩm chất lượng cao nên luôn được chú trọng từ những chi tiết mối nối nhỏ nhất\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGiá treo cứng cáp và nặng tay, mẫu mã sang trọng hiện đại\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/c8/3d/24/1039a1b7b552c9aba2189c49be8c30d2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/18/fb/a7/f07fd2243de2bb1919c0555a0e8cd265.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/b4/9c/28/961046464e9010185c7350d55a8ca66c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/33/53/69/4145bd85a310a07561e0a683cd434d19.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/da/b1/1a/8fb37a43d77473190562321fc4b6aa48.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/40/b1/cc/65299a84eda3075a62e4b899c3c6127a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/b0/fc/3f/c14e691b6dd1db530ffc20ce7384dbe0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/bf/92/3a/8a07c1ad7efe13852d967f267249f83e.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/fb/3b/2b/f6b1a34bf122198e6414b1f4fd8fdbdf.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/7c/2e/dd/1224665358f95f8d44